---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SurpriseMe from '../components/SurpriseMe.astro';
---
<Base title="about">
  <header class="section-head">
    <p class="label">cat about.txt</p>
    <h1>About</h1>
  </header>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>Hi. This is a small corner of the internet where I keep the things I notice: half-formed thoughts, photos of ordinary light, and books I can't stop talking about.</p>
    <p>None of it is in any particular order. That's on purpose. Wander around, press <kbd>r</kbd> whenever you like, and see where you end up.</p>
    <p class="mono soft">Write to me: <a href="mailto:hello@example.com">hello@example.com</a></p>
  </div>
  <SurpriseMe />
</Base>
